OL,3,GNEWSAJudge to decide over councillor
OL,4,Asocial media post
OL,5,
OL,6,FA judge will decide whether a suspended
OL,7,FReform UK councillor's post about
OL,8,FNigerians was simply "offensive" and
OL,9,Fprotected by his right to freedom of
OL,10,Fexpression or "grossly offensive".
OL,12,FGlenn Gibbins, 66, appeared at South
OL,13,FTyneside Magistrates' Court in
OL,14,Fconnection with a Facebook post from
OL,15,FMarch 2024, before he was elected to
OL,16,FSunderland City Council.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,398,390,260,160,0,100
