PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F397A1787329553
OL,1,W5j 5Q7kjs1 wsj#57sj  w{j#57i
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$ -,* %-.*,$%** %-& (,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAJudge to decide over councillor
OL,4,Asocial media post
OL,5,
OL,6,FNorthumbria Police said Gibbins had
OL,7,Fbeen charged under the Communications
OL,8,FAct 2003 with making an online post
OL,9,Fwhich referenced Nigerian people that
OL,10,Fwas grossly offensive or of an
OL,11,Findecent, obscene or menacing
OL,12,Fcharacter.
OL,14,FGibbins, who was granted unconditional
OL,15,Fbail, denied the offence and will
OL,16,Fappear at the same court again for
OL,17,Ftrial on 9 November.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
